  triage:closureNote "AI-REPLAN-AI52-QA-3: plan-phase-ai.md frontmatter target now integrate/phase-ai-31-33 (line 6), matching all 11 sibling sprint docs; its Baseline and branch policy section now explicitly defines integrate/phase-ai-31-33 (line 52) as branching from integrate/phase-AI for AI.31-AI.33 plus AI.39+ follow-up, merging forward into integrate/phase-AI. AI.33's own sprint doc frontmatter also updated to status: complete / target: integrate/phase-ai-31-33. Verified at f9e2351c by quality-mgr plus req-qa, arch-qa, ruthless-boundary-qa (unanimous)." ;
